      "text": "M and DL. To facilitate the performance analysis, assume that Um is uniformly distributed in the rectangle centered by the m-th waveguide, and Um’s location is denoted by ψm = (xm,ym,0). It is further assumed that a single pinching antenna is activated on the m-th waveguide at the location closest to Um, and hence its location can be denoted by ψmPin = (xm,βm,d), where d denotes the height of the waveguide and βm = −D",
